        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PH_JiminUnited/status/1987895049435394375",
        "text": "SPOTIFY - Philippines 🇵🇭 \nNovember 9, 2025 \n\n🎵 Daily Top Songs \n#62 - (🔼74) #Jimin_Who 😮🥳\nwith 129,997 (+11,077) streams \n\n👤 Daily Top Artist\n#132 - Jimin (🔼49) 🥳\n\nSPOTIFY - GLOBAL Daily Top Songs 🌍\n#22 - Jimin (🔼17) \nwith 2,233,480 (+118,240) streams 🥳\n\nJimin streamers are incredible! 💛 The Philippines jumped an impressive 74 spots, and our global streams are climbing again! 🌍 Let’s keep this powerful energy going — stream steadily, add Premium plays if you can, and stay safe as the typhoon passes. We’re doing amazing, Team Jimin! ✨",
